      "description": "Customize your KC HiLites Cyclone V2 LED light(s) to your color preference with this <strong>Replacement Lens</strong>. Made from nearly unbreakable Polycarbonate material and designed for long life. Easy snap-on, snap-off installation with the help of a screwdriver. Available in multiple color options from basic Clear or Diffused to Amber, Red, Blue, and Green. Available either individually or in packs of 6. Backed by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.",
      "details": "<ul id=\"product-tabs\" class=\"nav nav-pills\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li role=\"presentation\" class=\"active\"><a href=\"#learn\" id=\"learn-tab\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"learn\" aria-expanded=\"true\">Learn More</a></li>\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#specs\" id=\"specs-tab\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"specs\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Specs</a></li>\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#options\" id=\"options-tab\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"options\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Options</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tab-content product-tab-content\">\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade active in\" id=\"learn\" aria-labelledby=\"learn-tab\">\n<p><strong>Durable:</strong> Made from nearly unbreakable Polycarbonate.</p>\n<p><strong>Make Them Yours:</strong> Choose from Clear, Diffused, Amber, Red, Blue, or Green.</p>\n<p><strong>No Worries:</strong> Backed by KC for life!</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 installation-notes sub-section\">\n<a name=\"install\"></a>\n<div class=\"heading\">Installation Notes</div>\n<div class=\"installation-skill-level field\"><div class=\"field-title\">Installation Difficulty:</div><span class=\"skill-icon\"><img class=\"lazyload\" src=\"https://www.quadratec.com/sites/all/modules/custom/quadratec_base/projects/product_page/images/skill-level-2.png\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\" alt=\"Skill Level 2 Icon\"></span><span class=\"field-value\">Level 2</span><span class=\"field-value-sub\">Intermediate</span><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div><div class=\"installation-time field\"><span class=\"field-title\">Installation Time:</span> <span class=\"field-value\">Less than an hour</span><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div><div class=\"installation-instructions field\"><div class=\"instruction-set\"><div class=\"description\"></div><div class=\"install-file\"><img src=\"https://www.quadratec.com/sites/all/modules/custom/quadratec_base/projects/product_page/images/pdf.png\" class=\"lazyload file-icon\" width=\"53\" height=\"53\" alt=\"PDF Logo Install Instructions\"><a href=\"https://www.quadratec.com/sites/default/files/installation_instructions/LENS-REMOVAL-INSTRUCTIONS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Installation<br>Instructions</a></div></div></div> </div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 parts-included sub-section\">\n<div class=\"heading\">Parts Included</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Replacement Lens (1 or 6 depending on your selection)</li>\n</ul> </div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 warranty-info sub-section\">\n<div class=\"heading\">Warranty</div>\nLimited Lifetime Warranty </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"specs\" aria-labelledby=\"specs-tab\">\n<div id=\"product-specs\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled\"><li><b>Features:</b> <span>LED</span></li><li><b>Color:</b> <span>Clear LED or Amber LED or Red LED or Blue LED or Green LED</span></li><li><b>Light Pattern:</b> <span>Flood or Diffused</span></li><li><b>Lighting Type:</b> <span>Round</span></li></ul><div class=\"multi-product-specs-tagline\"><b>*Please make a selection above to view weight, dimensions, specs of a specific product</b></div></div> </div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"options\" aria-labelledby=\"options-tab\">\n<div itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Table\">\n<h2 itemprop=\"about\">KC HiLiTES Replacement Lens Options</h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-striped sticky-enabled\">\n<thead><tr><th>Part Number</th><th>Catalog #</th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th>Price</th><th></th> </tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>4400</td><td>14018-9074</td><td>Clear</td><td>Single</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>$3.99</td><td><div class=\"add-cart-link\"><a class=\"btn btn-success form-submit add-to-cart\" sku=\"202665\" pd=\"1031451\" fcid=\"356587\" qty=\"1\" onclick=\"google_tag_add_to_cart(1031451, 333297);product_cart_add(202